<app-nav title="{{screen === 'home' ? '活动共创' : title}}" show-back="{{screen !== 'home'}}" custom-back="{{screen !== 'home'}}" bindback="back" bindhome="hub"><view wx:if="{{screen === 'home'}}" class="nav-account" data-screen="profile" bindtap="navigate">我的</view></app-nav>
<view class="page  {{screen === 'stream' && activity.status === 'collecting' ? 'with-composer' : ''}}">

 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="link" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view>
 <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在加载…</view>
 <view wx:if="{{screen === 'privacy'}}" class="card prose"><view class="h2">隐私说明</view><text>微信身份标识用于关联账号，显示姓名仅用于展示。同名用户不会共享账号。\n\n活动文字和图片仅向有权限的成员展示；确认 AI 任务后，必要资料会发送给模型服务处理。\n\n公开文章通过主动分享的链接访问，管理者可关闭分享。撤回资料不会自动撤回已复制或发布到外部的内容。</text></view>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'name'}}"><view class="h1">怎么称呼你？</view><view class="field">显示姓名<input value="{{name}}" maxlength="30" placeholder="真实姓名或常用称呼" data-field="name" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="hint">姓名仅用于展示，可以与他人同名。</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="saveName">保存</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'home'}}">
  <view class="heading home-heading"><text class="h1">共创活动</text><view class="row"><button data-screen="join" bindtap="navigate">加入</button><button class="primary" data-screen="create" bindtap="navigate">＋ 创建</button></view></view>

  <scroll-view wx:if="{{user}}" scroll-x class="filters"><button wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{filter === item ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="setFilter">{{item}}</button></scroll-view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loading && !activities.length && !error}}" class="collab-empty"><view class="collab-symbol">✳</view><view class="collab-title">精彩，值得一起记录</view><view class="collab-sub">从一场活动，开始你们的共创。</view><button class="primary" data-screen="create" bindtap="navigate">发起第一场共创</button><button class="demo-disclosure" bindtap="demo">先看看成文效果　›</button></view>
  <view wx:for="{{activities}}" wx:key="id" class="card activity" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openActivity"><view class="heading"><text class="badge">{{item.statusText}}</text><text class="hint">{{item.roleText}}</text></view><view class="h2">{{item.name}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.description}}" class="description">{{item.description}}</view><view class="card-footer"><text>{{item.memberCount}} 人 · {{item.materialCount}} 份资料</text><text>文章 · {{item.articleText}}　›</text></view></view>
 </block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'demo'}}"><view class="card prose"><view class="hint">演示内容 · 以下人物与活动均为虚构</view><view class="h1">一起寻找校园里的秋天</view><view>周五下午，同学们带着观察卡走进校园。有人记录树叶的颜色，有人画下花坛的轮廓，还有人把发现写成一段小诗。</view><view>分享时，大家把各自的观察贴在同一张海报上。原来，每个人眼中的秋天都不一样，汇在一起就成了一段完整的班级记忆。</view><view class="h2">这篇文章怎样共创？</view><view>发起人提出活动主题，成员分别提交观察文字和照片；整理者挑选素材，生成草稿后核对事实，再决定是否分享。</view><button class="primary" data-screen="create" bindtap="navigate">创建我的共创活动</button></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'create' || screen === 'info'}}"><view class="field">活动名称 *<input value="{{name}}" maxlength="80" data-field="name" bindinput="input" placeholder="填写活动名称"/></view><view class="field">活动说明（选填）<textarea value="{{description}}" maxlength="2000" data-field="description" bindinput="input" placeholder="介绍活动内容或资料要求"/></view><button wx:if="{{screen === 'create'}}" class="primary" bindtap="create" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">创建活动</button><button wx:else class="primary" bindtap="saveInfo" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'created'}}"><view class="empty"><view class="h1">活动已创建</view><text>{{activity.name}}</text></view><button class="primary" data-screen="invite" bindtap="navigate">邀请参与者</button><button data-screen="stream" bindtap="navigate">进入活动</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'join'}}"><view class="field">六位邀请码<input value="{{inviteCode}}" data-field="inviteCode" bindinput="input" maxlength="6" type="number" placeholder="请输入邀请码"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="checkInvite" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">查看活动</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'invitation'}}"><view class="card"><view class="h1">{{invite.name}}</view><view class="description">{{invite.description}}</view><text class="badge">{{invite.statusText}}</text><view class="hint">{{invite.memberCount}} 位成员</view><view wx:if="{{invite.status === 'paused'}}" class="notice">活动暂停收集，加入后可查看，暂不能提交。</view><view wx:if="{{invite.status === 'archived'}}" class="notice">活动已归档，暂不接受新成员。</view><button wx:else class="primary" bindtap="join" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{invite.joined ? '进入活动' : '确认加入'}}</button></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'invite'}}"><view class="card center"><view class="h2">{{activity.name}}</view><view class="hint">邀请码</view><view class="invite-code">{{activity.inviteCode}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="copyInvite">复制邀请码</button><button open-type="share">分享活动给微信好友</button><button bindtap="showQr" loading="{{busy}}">活动二维码</button><image wx:if="{{qrImage}}" class="qr-image" src="{{qrImage}}" show-menu-by-longpress mode="widthFix"/></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'stream' || screen === 'materials' || screen === 'article' || screen === 'settings'}}">
  <view class="activity-header"><view class="h1">{{activity.name}}</view><view class="activity-meta"><text class="badge">{{activity.statusText}}</text><button class="link" data-screen="members" bindtap="navigate">{{activity.memberCount}} 位成员　›</button></view></view>
  <view class="activity-tabs"><button class="{{screen === 'stream' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-screen="stream" bindtap="navigate">资料</button><button wx:if="{{activity.manager}}" class="{{screen === 'materials' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-screen="materials" bindtap="navigate">选材</button><button class="{{screen === 'article' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-screen="article" bindtap="navigate">文章</button><button wx:if="{{activity.manager}}" class="{{screen === 'settings' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-screen="settings" bindtap="navigate">管理</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{screen === 'stream'}}">
   <button wx:if="{{newCount}}" class="link" bindtap="latest">有新资料，点击查看</button><view wx:if="{{activity.announcement}}" class="notice">{{activity.announcement}}</view><button wx:if="{{activity.manager && (activity.latestTask || task.activityId === activity.id)}}" class="link task-link" bindtap="taskPage">查看生成进度　›</button>
   <button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" class="link" bindtap="history" disabled="{{busy}}">加载历史资料</button>
   <view wx:if="{{!materials.length && !loading && !error}}" class="empty">还没有资料，发送文字或照片开始记录。</view>
   <view wx:for="{{materials}}" wx:key="id" class="message"><view class="avatar">{{item.initial}}</view><view class="message-body"><view class="message-meta"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.time}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.withdrawn}}" class="withdrawn">该资料已撤回</view><block wx:else><view class="bubble"><text user-select>{{item.text}}</text><view class="photos"><image wx:for="{{item.images}}" wx:for-item="photo" wx:key="path" src="{{photo.url}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load data-url="{{photo.url}}" data-urls="{{item.imageUrls}}" bindtap="previewPhoto"/></view></view><button wx:if="{{item.own && activity.writable}}" class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="withdraw">撤回</button></block></view></view><view id="latest-message"/>
   <view wx:if="{{activity.status === 'collecting'}}" class="composer {{keyboardHeight ? 'keyboard-open' : ''}}" style="bottom:{{keyboardHeight}}px"><textarea adjust-position="{{false}}" bindkeyboardheightchange="keyboardChange" value="{{message}}" maxlength="5000" data-field="message" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy || sendError}}" placeholder="填写文字或照片说明"/><view wx:if="{{photos.length}}" class="pending"><view wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="path"><image src="{{item.path}}" mode="aspectFill" data-url="{{item.path}}" bindtap="previewPhoto"/><button wx:if="{{!busy && !sendError}}" class="link" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removePhoto">移除</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{sendError}}" class="error">{{sendError}}，输入与照片已保留。</view><view wx:if="{{progress}}" class="hint">{{progress}}</view><view class="heading"><button class="link" bindtap="choosePhotos" disabled="{{busy || sendError}}">添加照片</button><button class="primary" bindtap="send" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{sendError ? '重试发送' : '发送'}}</button></view></view><view wx:else class="notice">{{activity.status === 'archived' ? '活动已归档，资料只读。' : '已暂停收集，暂时不能提交资料。'}}</view>
  </block>
  <block wx:if="{{screen === 'materials'}}">
   <view wx:if="{{!activity.writable}}" class="notice">活动已归档，素材只读。</view>
   <scroll-view wx:if="{{user}}" scroll-x class="filters"><button wx:for="{{materialFilters}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{materialFilter === item ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="setMaterialFilter">{{item}}</button></scroll-view>
   <view class="heading material-toolbar"><text class="hint">已选 {{checked.length}} 份</text><button bindtap="batchSelection" disabled="{{!activity.writable || busy}}">批量设置</button></view>
   <view wx:for="{{displayMaterials}}" wx:key="id" class="card material-card"><view class="heading"><checkbox-group data-id="{{item.id}}" bindchange="checkMaterial"><label><checkbox checked="{{item.checked}}" color="#285b4b"/>{{item.name}}</label></checkbox-group><text class="hint">{{item.stateText}}</text></view><view class="material-text">{{item.text}}</view><view class="photos"><image wx:for="{{item.images}}" wx:for-item="photo" wx:key="path" src="{{photo.url}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load data-url="{{photo.url}}" data-urls="{{item.imageUrls}}" bindtap="previewPhoto"/></view><picker range="{{choices}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindchange="setSelection" disabled="{{!activity.writable}}"><view class="select-row">{{item.stateText}}　⌄</view></picker></view><view wx:if="{{!displayMaterials.length && !loading}}" class="empty">没有相关资料</view><button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" bindtap="moreMaterials" disabled="{{busy}}">加载更多</button><button class="primary" bindtap="generate" disabled="{{!activity.writable || busy}}">生成草稿</button>
  </block>
  <block wx:if="{{screen === 'settings'}}">
   <view class="card"><button class="setting-row" bindtap="editInfo" disabled="{{!activity.writable}}"><text>活动信息</text><view class="setting-value"><text></text><text class="chevron">›</text></view></button><button class="setting-row" bindtap="editAnnouncement" disabled="{{!activity.writable}}"><text>活动公告</text><view class="setting-value"><text></text><text class="chevron">›</text></view></button><button class="setting-row" data-screen="members" bindtap="navigate"><text>成员与协作者</text><view class="setting-value"><text></text><text class="chevron">›</text></view></button><button wx:if="{{activity.owner}}" class="setting-row" bindtap="collection"><text>收集状态</text><view class="setting-value"><text>{{activity.statusText}}</text><text class="chevron">›</text></view></button><button class="setting-row" data-screen="invite" bindtap="navigate" disabled="{{!activity.writable}}"><text>邀请参与者</text><view class="setting-value"><text></text><text class="chevron">›</text></view></button><button wx:if="{{activity.owner}}" class="setting-row" bindtap="resetInvite" disabled="{{!activity.writable}}"><text>重置邀请</text><view class="setting-value"><text></text><text class="chevron">›</text></view></button></view><view wx:if="{{!activity.owner}}" class="hint">协作者可整理资料与编辑文章，成员权限由发起人管理。</view>
  </block>
  <block wx:if="{{screen === 'article'}}">
   <view wx:if="{{!article && !loading && !error}}" class="empty">还没有文章<button wx:if="{{activity.manager}}" class="primary" bindtap="generate">生成草稿</button></view>
   <block wx:if="{{article}}"><view class="heading"><text class="badge">{{article.statusText}}</text><text class="hint">版本 {{article.revision}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{article.changed && activity.manager}}" class="notice">资料或活动信息已变化，请在定稿前核对。</view><view class="article-paper"><view class="h1">{{article.title}}</view><text wx:for="{{article.paragraphs}}" wx:key="index" class="paragraph" user-select>{{item}}</text><view wx:for="{{article.images}}" wx:key="path"><image class="article-image" src="{{item.url}}" mode="widthFix" lazy-load data-url="{{item.url}}" data-urls="{{article.imageUrls}}" bindtap="previewPhoto"/><view class="caption">{{item.caption}}</view></view></view>
   <block wx:if="{{activity.manager}}"><view class="button-grid"><button bindtap="editArticle" disabled="{{!activity.writable}}">编辑文章</button><button bindtap="versions">历史版本</button><button bindtap="used">采用资料</button><button bindtap="generate" disabled="{{!activity.writable}}">重新生成</button></view><view wx:if="{{article.status === 'draft' && activity.writable}}"><checkbox-group bindchange="reviewed"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{reviewed}}" color="#285b4b"/>我已核对活动事实与资料变化</label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" bindtap="finalize" disabled="{{busy}}">确认定稿</button></view><button wx:if="{{article.status === 'final'}}" class="primary" bindtap="sharePage">分享与发布</button><view class="heading"><text>对活动成员开放</text><switch checked="{{visible}}" color="#285b4b" bindchange="memberVisibility" disabled="{{!activity.writable || busy}}"/></view></block></block>
  </block>
 </block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'members'}}"><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{members}}" wx:key="userId" class="member"><view><text>{{item.name}}</text><view class="hint">{{item.roleText}}{{item.ai && item.role === 'collaborator' ? ' · 已获 AI 授权' : ''}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{activity.owner && activity.writable && item.role !== 'owner'}}" class="link" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="memberAction">管理</button></view></view><button wx:if="{{activity.manager && activity.writable}}" class="primary" data-screen="invite" bindtap="navigate">邀请参与者</button><view wx:if="{{activity.owner}}" class="hint">协作者默认没有消费点数权限，需单独授权。</view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'announcement'}}"><view class="field">活动公告<textarea value="{{announcement}}" maxlength="1000" data-field="announcement" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="saveAnnouncement" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'generate'}}"><view class="field">选材方式<picker range="{{modes}}" value="{{modeIndex}}" data-field="modeIndex" bindchange="picker"><view class="select-row">{{modes[modeIndex]}}　⌄</view></picker></view><view class="hint">指定采用会纳入，指定排除不参与生成。</view><view class="field">篇幅<picker range="{{lengths}}" value="{{lengthIndex}}" data-field="lengthIndex" bindchange="picker"><view class="select-row">{{lengths[lengthIndex]}}　⌄</view></picker></view><view class="field">语气<picker range="{{tones}}" value="{{toneIndex}}" data-field="toneIndex" bindchange="picker"><view class="select-row">{{tones[toneIndex]}}　⌄</view></picker></view><view class="field">重点（选填）<textarea value="{{focus}}" maxlength="500" data-field="focus" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="quote" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认费用</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'quote'}}"><view class="card"><view class="setting-row">文字 {{quote.texts}} 份 · 图片 {{quote.images}} 张</view><view wx:if="{{quote.visionEnabled}}" class="setting-row">待识图 {{quote.pendingImages}} 张</view><view class="setting-row">预计冻结 {{quote.price}} 点</view><view class="setting-row">发起人可用点数 {{quote.balance}} 点</view></view><view class="hint">由发起人账户支付。确认后冻结点数，未交付完整草稿全额退还。</view><view wx:if="{{quote.balance < quote.price}}" class="notice">点数不足，请发起人联系运营者补充。资料收集和手工编辑不受影响。</view><button wx:else class="primary" bindtap="startTask" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认并生成</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'task'}}"><view wx:if="{{task}}" class="card center"><view class="h1">{{task.stageText}}</view><view class="hint">本次任务 {{task.price}} 点</view><view class="description">{{task.error}}</view><view wx:if="{{task.stage === 'queued' || task.stage === 'vision' || task.stage === 'writing'}}" class="notice">可以离开页面，稍后查看原任务进度。</view><view wx:if="{{task.stage === 'review'}}" class="notice">正在核实原任务，不会重复调用或自动退款。</view><view wx:if="{{task.stage === 'failed'}}" class="notice">冻结点数已退还。</view><button wx:if="{{task.stage === 'succeeded'}}" class="primary" data-screen="article" bindtap="navigate">查看草稿</button><button bindtap="retry">刷新任务状态</button><button data-screen="stream" bindtap="navigate">返回活动</button></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'edit'}}"><view class="heading"><text class="hint">{{dirty ? '有未保存修改' : '已保存'}}</text><button class="primary" bindtap="saveArticle" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">保存</button></view><view class="field">标题<input value="{{editTitle}}" maxlength="160" data-field="editTitle" bindinput="editInput"/></view><view class="field">正文<textarea class="body-editor" value="{{editBody}}" maxlength="15000" data-field="editBody" bindinput="editInput"/></view><view class="h2">配图</view><view wx:for="{{editImages}}" wx:key="path" class="card"><image class="article-image" src="{{item.url}}" mode="widthFix"/><input value="{{item.caption}}" maxlength="300" placeholder="图片说明（选填）" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="caption"/><view class="row"><button class="link" data-index="{{index}}" data-step="-1" bindtap="moveImage">上移</button><button class="link" data-index="{{index}}" data-step="1" bindtap="moveImage">下移</button><button class="link" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeImage">移除</button></view></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'versions'}}"><view wx:for="{{versions}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openVersion"><view class="heading"><text>版本 {{item.revision}} · {{item.statusText}}</text><text>›</text></view><view class="description">{{item.title}}</view><view class="hint">{{item.time}}</view></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'version'}}"><view class="article-paper"><view class="h1">{{version.title}}</view><text wx:for="{{version.paragraphs}}" wx:key="index" class="paragraph">{{item}}</text><image wx:for="{{version.images}}" wx:key="path" class="article-image" src="{{item.url}}" mode="widthFix"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="restoreVersion" disabled="{{!activity.writable || busy}}">恢复此版本</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'used'}}"><view class="card"><view class="h2">采用资料</view><view wx:for="{{article.usedDetails}}" wx:key="id" class="material-text"><text>{{item.name}}</text><view class="hint">{{item.withdrawn ? '该资料已撤回，请核对文章' : item.text}}</view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="h2">未采用摘要</view><view wx:for="{{omitted}}" wx:key="id">{{item.reason}}</view><view class="hint">指定排除资料未传入本次任务。</view></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'share'}}"><view class="card"><view class="h2">文章链接</view><view class="hint">电脑打开链接后可复制到公众号后台；也可直接分享给他人阅读。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="enableShare" disabled="{{busy}}">{{article.shareEnabled ? '生成新的分享链接' : '开启分享并生成链接'}}</button><button wx:if="{{article.shareEnabled}}" bindtap="copyArticleLink">复制文章链接</button><button wx:if="{{article.shareEnabled}}" class="link" bindtap="closeShare">关闭公开分享</button><view wx:if="{{article.shareEnabled}}" class="hint">重新生成分享链接会使旧链接失效。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="h2">发布记录</view><input value="{{publishUrl}}" placeholder="公众号文章链接（选填）" data-field="publishUrl" bindinput="input"/><button bindtap="markPublished" disabled="{{busy || !activity.writable}}">手动标记已发布</button><view class="hint">仅作记录，系统不会自动发布公众号。</view></view></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'profile'}}"><view class="card profile-card"><view class="heading"><text class="h1">{{user.name}}</text><button class="link" bindtap="rename">修改姓名</button></view></view><view class="card"><view class="hint">可用点数</view><view class="balance-summary"><text class="balance-number">{{user.balance}}</text><text class="hint">点</text></view><view class="setting-row" data-screen="points" bindtap="navigate"><text>点数明细</text><view class="setting-value"><text></text><text class="chevron">›</text></view></view><view class="setting-row"><text>冻结点数</text><text class="setting-value">{{user.frozen}} 点</text></view><view class="setting-row" data-screen="help" bindtap="navigate"><text>使用说明</text><view class="setting-value"><text></text><text class="chevron">›</text></view></view></view><view class="hint">点数不足请联系运营者申请补充。</view><button class="quiet-button" bindtap="logout" disabled="{{busy}}">退出登录</button></block>
 <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'points'}}"><view class="card heading"><text>可用 {{user.balance}} 点</text><text>冻结 {{user.frozen}} 点</text></view><view class="hint">点数不足请联系运营者申请补充。</view><view wx:if="{{!ledger.length && !error}}" class="empty">暂无点数记录</view><view wx:for="{{ledger}}" wx:key="id" class="card heading" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="pointDetail"><view><view>{{item.label}}</view><view class="hint">{{item.time}}</view></view><text>{{item.amount > 0 ? '+' : ''}}{{item.amount}}</text></view><button wx:if="{{hasMorePoints}}" bindtap="morePoints" disabled="{{busy}}">加载更多</button></block>
 <view wx:elif="{{screen === 'help'}}" class="card prose"><view class="h2">使用说明</view><text>创建活动后分享邀请，参与者可以提交文字与照片。\n\n发起人和协作者可整理素材、生成和编辑文章。协作者使用 AI 需单独获得授权，消耗发起人的点数。\n\n创建、收集、手工编辑、定稿和导出免费。AI 任务确认费用后才启动。\n\n文章定稿后可以分享链接，或在电脑打开链接，将正文复制到公众号后台手动发布。</text></view>
 <view wx:elif="{{screen === 'access'}}" class="empty">没有活动访问权限，可能已被移出。<button bindtap="goHome">返回共创活动</button></view>

</view>
